#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "A guide for teams and organizations in the early stages of quantum initiative development."
msgstr "Panduan untuk pasukan dan organisasi pada peringkat awal pembangunan inisiatif kuantum."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Gambaran Keseluruhan"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "{/* cspell:ignore QDAs */}\n"
msgstr "{/* cspell:ignore QDAs */}\n"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview {#overview}"
msgstr "Gambaran Keseluruhan {#overview}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![\"Hero image\"](/learning/images/courses/designing-and-leading-quantum-projects/hero.svg)\n"
msgstr "![\"Hero image\"](/learning/images/courses/designing-and-leading-quantum-projects/hero.svg)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This course is designed to assist teams and organizations to effectively build the necessary capabilities to successfully kick-start quantum initiatives. \n"
msgstr "Kursus ini direka untuk membantu pasukan dan organisasi membina keupayaan yang diperlukan bagi memulakan inisiatif kuantum dengan jayanya.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We recommend devoting approximately 4 hours to completing this content, depending on one's prior experience.\n"
msgstr "Kami syorkan agar anda peruntukkan kira-kira 4 jam untuk menyelesaikan kandungan ini, bergantung pada pengalaman sebelumnya.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Intended audience {#intended-audience}"
msgstr "Sasaran audiens {#intended-audience}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We recommend this course for leaders and architects of quantum initiatives, including academic faculty, project leaders in large enterprises, startup leadership, and more. It will be of particular use to organizations new to quantum computing.\n"
msgstr "Kami syorkan kursus ini untuk pemimpin dan arkitek inisiatif kuantum, termasuk tenaga akademik, ketua projek di perusahaan besar, kepimpinan syarikat permulaan, dan lain-lain. Kursus ini amat berguna untuk organisasi yang baru dalam pengkomputeran kuantum.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Recommended background {#recommended-background}"
msgstr "Latar belakang yang disyorkan {#recommended-background}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "There is no technical prerequisite for this course, but we recommend that learners first take the [Quantum Business Foundations](/learning/courses/quantum-business-foundations) course, which is a good introduction to the quantum ecosystem.\n"
msgstr "Tiada prasyarat teknikal untuk kursus ini, tetapi kami syorkan agar pelajar terlebih dahulu mengambil kursus [Quantum Business Foundations](/learning/courses/quantum-business-foundations), yang merupakan pengenalan yang baik kepada ekosistem kuantum.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you have questions or concerns regarding this course, please contact the IBM Quantum Learning&reg; team.\n"
msgstr "Jika anda ada sebarang soalan atau kebimbangan berkenaan kursus ini, sila hubungi pasukan IBM Quantum Learning&reg;.\n"
